{"id": "55279", "title": "情动", "author": "梓妃渔", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 7, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/55/55279.htm", "intro": "楠竹和女主交往过一段时间，觉得自己厌烦了女主，被女主撞到和女配OOXX之后，和女主分手，后来发现仍然深爱女主，各种死缠烂打（当然各种船是少不了的），结局HE。", "base": "files/article/html/55/55279", "chapters": [{"title": "1-6", "file": "7593862.html", "available": false}, {"title": "7-11", "file": "7593863.html", "available": false}, {"title": "12-17", "file": "7593864.html", "available": false}, {"title": "18-24", "file": "7593865.html", "available": false}, {"title": "25-30", "file": "7593866.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-36", "file": "7593867.html", "available": false}, {"title": "37-42", "file": "7593868.html", "available": false}]}